# Finance Role

Financial Control Center only: revenue, expenses, instructor payments, withdrawals, shareholders, reports. No students/courses/academic/research/settings.

## Sidebar

Dashboard · Revenue · Expenses · Instructor Payments · Withdrawals · Shareholders · Reports · Notifications · Profile · Logout

## Dashboard

Stats: Total Revenue, Total Expenses, Net Profit, Pending Withdrawals, Total Instructor Payments.
(Do not show Active Shareholders on dashboard stats.)
Overviews + Pending Withdrawals + financial summary chart.
Quick Actions: Add Expense, Add Manual Income, Review Withdrawals, View Reports. Notifications via header only.
Do not show Recent Revenue / Recent Expenses cards on the dashboard.

## Key rules

- Instructor earnings read-only (auto from purchases)
- Withdrawals: Approve → Completed; Reject requires reason + notify
- Shareholders: Super Admin creates; Finance manages distribution view only
- Manual income & expenses update finance totals
